sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant C as Caller
participant G as Target GAS
participant E as GameplayEffect
participant M as EffectModifiers
participant S as EffectSystemComponent
participant P as Spec and its workers
participant A as AttributeSystemComponent
participant D as Source ASC
C->>G: GenerateEffectSpec(origin, effect)
G->>E: GASCore.GenerateEffectSpec, Generate(origin, target)
E->>E: ImpactSpecification.RebuildEntries(Duration)
E->>P: new GameplayEffectSpec(this, origin, target)
E->>P: ApplyImpactSpecifications, the scalers' Initialize
E->>M: EffectModifiers.Apply(spec)
M-->>P: outgoing and incoming rules fill spec.Changes
C->>G: ApplyCarrier(spec) or ApplyGameplayEffect(spec)
G->>S: ApplyGameplayEffect(spec)
S->>S: gates: dead target, requirements, conditions, immunity, chance
S->>S: stop stages Block or Evade, Area lands on others in range
S->>S: Land(spec) numbers the ApplicationId
alt Instant
S->>S: grant the tags
S->>P: RunWorkerApplication, components Land
S->>A: CommitImpact(attr, SMAV(spec), OnApply impacters)
S->>P: transfers Move, RunWorkerRemoval and components End, remove the tags
else Durational or Infinite
S->>S: re-application by EEffectReApplicationPolicy, components Reapply when taken in
S->>S: GenerateContainer(spec, ongoing), Shelve, GrantedTagCompiler.AddEffect
S->>S: LendAbilities: OnHits, modifiers, WorkerGroup, sides, components Lend, GrantedAbilities
S->>A: RegisterModifier(attr, SMAV(spec), Continuous impacters)
S->>P: RunWorkerApplication, components Land
S->>A: if ongoing, TickOnApplication or the OnApply commits
end
S->>S: the cleanse RemovesEffectsTagged, ForgePurge.Purge(Purges)
S->>G: FrameSummary.RecordEffectApplied, Callbacks.EffectApplied(spec)
S->>S: the contained OnApply effects
A->>G: after each change, RecordFrameImpactReceived
A->>D: ProvideFrameImpactDealt(impact)
D->>P: TrackImpact, OnEffectImpact, components Hit
D->>D: ImpactWorkerCache.RunImpactData, RecordFrameImpactDealt
loop each GASCore.Tick
S->>P: TickPeriodic(dt of the target's clock), RunWorkerTick, components Tick
S->>A: Callbacks.EffectTick, n periodic commits
S->>S: UpdateTimeRemaining, MarkFinished when expired
end
S->>A: ClearFinishedEffects: OnRemove, ReverseImpact, UnregisterModifier
S->>P: TakeBackAbilities with components TakeBack, RunWorkerRemoval and components End
S->>G: Callbacks.EffectRemoved(spec), the tag recompile
Note over S,A: OnApply and Periodic commits never reverse
Note over S,P: Its cues play through its Cues component, as the components hear Lend, Land, Tick, End and TakeBack
